# Every pull request automatically requests review from the maintainer below.
# That is a request, not a gate.
#
# Branch protection on main currently requires a pull request and zero
# approvals, so nothing in this file blocks a merge. It was a gate until
# 2026-09-08, when "Require review from Code Owners" was turned off: a sole
# code owner cannot approve their own pull request, so the setting blocked
# every pull request the maintainer opened, and only an admin override could
# land one.
#
# Turn it back on once contributors other than the maintainer are opening pull
# requests. Do not turn it on while the maintainer is the only author, or the
# deadlock returns.
